1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,936
Why do people who spend four

2
00:00:01,936 --> 00:00:05,047
hours comparing fifty nearly identical hotels

3
00:00:05,047 --> 00:00:07,190
end up less happy than decisive

4
00:00:07,190 --> 00:00:09,610
travelers who pick in five minutes?

5
00:00:09,610 --> 00:00:12,305
Nobel laureate Herbert Simon coined satisficing

6
00:00:12,305 --> 00:00:14,025
in 1956 for choosing the first

7
00:00:14,025 --> 00:00:15,975
option that meets clear standards.

8
00:00:15,975 --> 00:00:16,434
In 2002,

9
00:00:16,434 --> 00:00:19,243
psychologist Barry Schwartz and colleagues proved

10
00:00:19,243 --> 00:00:22,111
relentless maximizers experience higher regret and

11
00:00:22,111 --> 00:00:23,200
