17
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:36,522
Reserve exhaustive research for rare,

18
00:00:36,522 --> 00:00:38,041
irreversible life bets.

19
00:00:38,041 --> 00:00:40,219
For everyday tools and purchases,

20
00:00:40,219 --> 00:00:42,331
define three must-have criteria,

21
00:00:42,331 --> 00:00:43,850
set a ten-minute timer,

22
00:00:43,850 --> 00:00:45,500
and pick the first match.

23
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:48,178
Satisfice small reversible choices quickly so

24
00:00:48,178 --> 00:00:50,321
your best mental energy stays locked

25
00:00:50,321 --> 00:00:51,630
